    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061209.0030\n\nWASHINGTON, Dec 9 , 2006, 2006\n\nUS Congress passes bill to normalize trade with Vietnam\n\n\n\n\nThe US Congress early Saturday gave its final approval to a bill to restore normal trade ties with Vietnam.\n\nThe bill granting \"permanent normal trade relations\" (PNTR) status to Vietnam was part of a large omnibus measure approved by the Senate 79-9 during an all-night session.\n\nThe US House of Representatives voted for it 212-184 late Friday.",
